app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

pull request
  m         m    merge             on
  x         x    close             on
  X         X    reopen            off
  D         D    convert to draft  on
  esc       esc  back              on
  enter     ↵    open              off
  C         C    checks            on
  ]         ]    next state        off
  [         [    previous state    off
  F         F    clear filters     off
  r ctrl+r  r    refresh           on
  o         o    open in browser   on
  f         f    filter            off
  s         s    sort              off
  @         @    owner page        on

thread
  up k            ↑/k     up            on
  down j          ↓/j     down          on
  pgup b          b/pgup  page up       on
  pgdown f space  f/pgdn  page down     on
  ctrl+u u        u       ½ page up     on
  ctrl+d d        d       ½ page down   on
  home g          g/home  top           on
  end G           G/end   bottom        on
  enter           ↵       diagram code  off
  r ctrl+r        r       retry         off
